  "description": "<p>This personalized doormat offers a warm and cheerful welcome, designed specifically for classrooms. Featuring a unique Composition Notebook style, it adds a special, friendly touch to any learning environment. Ideal for welcoming students or as a thoughtful gift for educators.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with a teacher's name for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>Made from soft, durable non-woven fabric with a non-slip backing.</li>\n<li>Effectively traps dirt, dust, and grime to keep floors clean.</li>\n<li>Heat-resistant material ensures long-lasting use.</li>\n<li>Versatile for both indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain with simple washing instructions.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Composition Notebook Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Classroom</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Personalization</td>\n<td>Text Input</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width=100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft non-woven fabric top</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Washable; hose down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap. Avoid bleaching and air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This personalized doormat is perfect for classrooms, entryways, and RVs, creating a welcoming atmosphere for students and guests. Its durable design is suitable for various indoor and outdoor spaces where a cheerful and functional accent is desired.</p>",
